  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> <a style=\"color: #ff0000;\" href=\"https://rssb.rajasthan.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Rajasthan Staff Selection Board (RSSB)</a> </span>has recently released the official notification for the post of Junior Engineer on the official website of RSSB. This recruitment has been issued for 874 posts. Online applying process for RSSB Junior Engineer Recruitment 2026 has started from 16 August 2026 and candidate can apply untill 14 September 2026. Candidates must check the complete details for RSSB Junior Engineer Recruitment 2026 which has given below.</span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Rajasthan Staff Selection Board (RSSB)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">RSSB Junior Engineer Recruitment 2026</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">RSSB Advt No. : 10/2026</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>16 August 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>14 September 2026</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>14 September 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Exam Date : <strong>Notify Latter</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card : <strong>Before Exam</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General, EBC, OBC (Creamy Layer) <strong>: Rs. 600/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">EWS , OBC (Non Creamy Layer), EWS <strong>:</strong> <strong>Rs. 400/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC, ST, PH <strong>: Rs. 400/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Correction Charge&nbsp;<b>: Rs. 300/-</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[adinserter block=”3″]</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>RSSB Junior Engineer Notification 2026 : Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Age Limit As On 01 January 2027</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Minimum Age :&nbsp;<strong>18 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>40 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation as per RSSB Junior Engineer Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Use <span style=\"background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool –</span> </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>RSSB Junior Engineer 2026 : Vacancy Details</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Total Posts : 874 Posts</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Department Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>No. of Post</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Public Works Department</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">393</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Water Resources Department</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">251</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Department of Public Health Engineering</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">230</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>RSSB Junior Engineer Recruitment 2026 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 32.9612%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 67.0388%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Qualification</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 32.9612%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Junior Engineer (Civil) – Degree Holder</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 67.0388%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates must have a Degree in Civil Engineering or an equivalent qualification from a recognized university/institution. Practical knowledge of Hindi written in Devanagari script and knowledge of Rajasthan culture are also required.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 32.9612%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Junior Engineer (Civil) – Diploma Holder</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 67.0388%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates must have a Diploma in Civil Engineering from a recognized institution or an equivalent qualification recognized by the Institution of Engineers. Practical knowledge of Hindi written in Devanagari script and knowledge of Rajasthan culture are also required.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 32.9612%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Junior Engineer (Mechanical/Electrical) – Diploma Holder</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 67.0388%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates must have a Diploma in Mechanical/Electrical Engineering from a recognized institution or an equivalent qualification recognized by the Institution of Engineers. Practical knowledge of Hindi written in Devanagari script and knowledge of Rajasthan culture are also required.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>RSSB Junior Engineer Online Form 2026 : How To Apply</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates can apply through link https://rssb.rajasthan.gov.in/ or provided below in link section or they can also apply through official site of the RSSB before Last Date.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">You Can Check other <a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"https://www.sarkariexam.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Sarkari Result</a>&nbsp;Notification Here – <a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"https://www.sarkariexam.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Check Now.</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">For all the interested and eligible candidates who want to apply for RSSB Junior Engineer recruitment can read all the information related to the recruitment is given below and the link to apply is given in the Important Link section below.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #ff0000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Note – छात्रो से ये अनुरोध किया जाता है की वो अपना फॉर्म भरने से पहले Official Notification (Last Date, Age Limit, Qualification) को ध्यान से जरूर पढे उसके बाद ही अपना फॉर्म भरे ।</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>RSSB Junior Engineer Recruitment 2026 : Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Written Exam</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Document Verification</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Medical Examination</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[adinserter block=”3″]</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable2\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><strong>Follow Sarkar